# Build context for apps/*/Dockerfile is the repository root (Phase 18,
# docs/features/phase-18-production-hardening/plan.md §18). Nothing below
# may reach an image: secrets, local installs, build output, VCS data.

# Secrets and local configuration — never baked into an image (plan.md §7).
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Local installs and build output; images install and build their own.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache

# Not needed to build or run any app.
.git
.claude
docs
infrastructure
**/*.md
